ection and try again.":[""],"Add Source":["Dodaj \u017ar\u00f3d\u0142o"],"Loading, please wait":[""],"Review Feed Pro by Smash Balloon":["Reviews Feed Pro od Smash Balloon"],"Activate your plugin to get started":["W\u0142\u0105cz wtyczk\u0119, aby rozpocz\u0105\u0107"],"Paste license key here":["Wklej tutaj klucz licencyjny"],"License Activated!":["W\u0142\u0105czono licencj\u0119!"],"Invalid License!":["Niewa\u017cna licencja!"],"Don\u2019t have a license key?":["Nie masz klucza licencyjnego?"],"Buy a License":["Kup licencj\u0119"],"After activating your plugin, you can...":["Po w\u0142\u0105czeniu wtyczki zyskasz poni\u017csze mo\u017cliwo\u015bci..."],"Collect New Reviews":["Zbieranie nowych opinii"],"New reviews and data related to the reviews for your business are collected from external sites. Your license key can be used to access this data using Smash Balloon's API site.":["Nowe opinie na temat twojej firmy i zwi\u0105zane z nimi dane s\u0105 zbierane z witryn zewn\u0119trznych. Klucz licencyjny umo\u017cliwia dost\u0119p do tych danych przy u\u017cyciu witryny API zespo\u0142u Smash Balloon."],"With constant changes to WordPress and the APIs that your reviews are retrieved from, your plugin needs to stay up to date. Activating your license allows automatic updates from the Plugins page.":["Ze wzgl\u0119du na ci\u0105g\u0142e zmiany wprowadzane w WordPressie i interfejsach API, z kt\u00f3rych s\u0105 pobierane opinie, wtyczka musi by\u0107 stale aktualizowana. W\u0142\u0105czenie licencji umo\u017cliwia wykonywanie automatycznych aktualizacji z poziomu strony Wtyczki."],"Receive Technical Support":["Korzystanie z pomocy technicznej"],"Although we pride ourselves on creating reliable, easy-to-use products our expert support team is here to help with any questions. Activating your license key is recommended to receive efficient support.":["Chocia\u017c szczycimy si\u0119 tworzeniem niezawodnych, \u0142atwych w obs\u0142udze produkt\u00f3w, nasz do\u015bwiadczony zesp\u00f3\u0142 pomocy technicznej ch\u0119tnie pomo\u017ce w razie jakichkolwiek pyta\u0144. Zalecamy w\u0142\u0105czenie klucza licencyjnego, co zapewni sprawny dost\u0119p do pomocy technicznej."],"Amazing Support Team.":["Fantastyczna pomoc techniczna."],"Having trouble using the plugin?":["Masz problemy z u\u017cywaniem wtyczki?"],"Contact our friendly support team.":["Skontaktuj si\u0119 z naszym \u017cyczliwym zespo\u0142em pomocy technicznej."],"Go to Support Form":["Przejd\u017a do formularza pomocy technicznej"],"Create a feed":["Utw\u00f3rz kana\u0142"],"Dashboard":["Kokpit"],"Create a Review feed":["Utw\u00f3rz kana\u0142 opinii"],"more":[""],"Confirm":["Potwierd\u017a"],"You are using the new Google Places API":[""],"New API":[""],"License Key ":["Klucz licencyjny "],"Your ":["Tw\u00f3j "]," License is ":[" Licencja jest "],"Active":["W\u0142\u0105czono"],"Inactive":["Wy\u0142\u0105czono"],"Expired":["Wygas\u0142a"],"Manage License":["Zarz\u0105dzaj licencj\u0105"],"Test Connection":["Przetestuj po\u0142\u0105czenie"],"Connection Error":["B\u0142\u0105d po\u0142\u0105czenia"],"Upgrade":["Ulepsz"],"Deactivate":["Wy\u0142\u0105cz"],"This source is not used by any feeds.":[""],"Are you sure you want to delete it?":[""],"feed":[""],"This source is used by":[""],"Delete ":["Usu\u0144 "],"Source Deleted!":["Usuni\u0119to \u017ar\u00f3d\u0142o!"],"Select feed to export":[""],"Export":["Eksportuj"],"Original Text":["Tekst oryginalny"],"Custom text\/translation":["Tekst w\u0142asny\/t\u0142umaczenie"],"Context":["Kontekst"],"New Reviews collected daily.":["Nowe opinie s\u0105 zbierane codziennie."],"Clearing caches will trigger a full resync of all reviews. This may take a few minutes and could temporarily slow down your site.":[""],"Clear All Caches":["Wyczy\u015b\u0107 wszystkie pami\u0119ci podr\u0119czne"],"You are using the Lite version of the plugin\u2013no license needed. Enjoy! \ud83d\ude42 To unlock more features, consider ":["Korzystasz z wersji Lite wtyczki \u2014 do tego nie potrzeba licencji. Powodzenia! \ud83d\ude42 Aby uzyska\u0107 dost\u0119p do dodatkowych funkcji, rozwa\u017c "],"Upgrading to Pro":["Zakup Pro"],"As a valued user of our Lite plugin, you receive 50% OFF - automatically applied at checkout!":["Doceniamy to, \u017ce korzystasz z wtyczki Lite, dlatego otrzymujesz od nas 50% ZNI\u017bKI, kt\u00f3ra zostanie automatycznie zastosowana na etapie p\u0142atno\u015bci!"],"Install Pro":["Zainstaluj Pro"],"Select collection to export":[""],"Collection JSON exported!":[""],"Save Changes":["Zapisz zmiany"],"Plugin Installed":["Zainstalowano wtyczk\u0119"],"Unknown Error":["Nieznany b\u0142\u0105d"],"Plugin Activated":["W\u0142\u0105czono wtyczk\u0119"],"Plugin Deactivated":["Wy\u0142\u0105czono wtyczk\u0119"],"About Us":["O nas"],"SmashBalloon Team":["Zesp\u00f3\u0142 Smash Balloon"],"At Smash Balloon, we build software that helps you create beautiful responsive social media feeds for your website in minutes.":["W Smash Balloon tworzymy oprogramowanie, dzi\u0119ki kt\u00f3remu z \u0142atwo\u015bci\u0105 w kilka minut dodasz do swojej witryny internetowej atrakcyjne, responsywne kana\u0142y medi\u00f3w spo\u0142eczno\u015bciowych."],"We're on a mission to make it super simple to add social media feeds in WordPress. No more complicated setup steps, ugly iframe widgets, or negative page speed scores.":["Chcemy sprawi\u0107, by dodawanie kana\u0142\u00f3w medi\u00f3w spo\u0142eczno\u015bciowych do WordPressa by\u0142o niezwykle proste. Koniec ze skomplikowan\u0105 konfiguracj\u0105, brzydkimi wid\u017cetami iframe czy s\u0142abymi wynikami pomiar\u00f3w szybko\u015bci stron."],"Our plugins aren't just easy to use, but completely customizable, reliable, and fast! Which is why over 1.6 million awesome users, just like you, choose to use them on their site.":["Nasze wtyczki s\u0105 nie tylko \u0142atwe w u\u017cyciu, ale te\u017c w pe\u0142ni konfigurowalne, niezawodne i szybkie! To w\u0142a\u015bnie dlatego u\u017cywa ich w swoich witrynach ponad 1,6 miliona tak wspania\u0142ych u\u017cytkownik\u00f3w jak ty."],"Our Other Social Media Feed Plugins":["Inne nasze wtyczki do kana\u0142\u00f3w medi\u00f3w spo\u0142eczno\u015bciowych"],"We're more than just a Reviews plugin! Check out our other plugins and add more content to your site.":["Oferujemy nie tylko wtyczk\u0119 do obs\u0142ugi opinii! Zapoznaj si\u0119 z naszymi pozosta\u0142ymi wtyczkami i dodaj wi\u0119cej tre\u015bci do swojej witryny."],"Install":["Zainstaluj"],"Installed":["Zainstalowano"],"Social Wall":["Social Wall"],"Combine feeds from all of our plugins into a single wall":["Po\u0142\u0105cz kana\u0142y ze wszystkich naszych wtyczek na jednej tablicy"],"Plugins we recommend":["Polecane wtyczki"],"What are they used for?":[""],"Solving an issue in your plugin might sometime require testing API access but with your setup. We do not want to expose your API keys over support messages and hence we use a temporary login link system to securely access it.":[""],"What can a support executive access?":[""],"A support team member can only access Smash Balloon plugin to make API requests. They can NOT access any other plugins, create posts or in any way modify your WordPress website.":[""],"Can I disable or delete the temporary login link?":[""],"The login link is auto-destroyed in 14 days. You can also manually delete it any time you want.":[""],"Temporary Login Links":[""],"Dismiss":["Odrzu\u0107"],"Search Documentation":["Przeszukaj dokumentacj\u0119"],"Need more support? We're here to help.":["Potrzebujesz dodatkowego wsparcia? Ch\u0119tnie pomo\u017cemy."],"Submit a Support Ticket":["Prze\u015blij zg\u0142oszenie"],"Get Help in the WordPress.org Forum":["Uzyskaj pomoc na forum WordPress.org"],"Our fast and friendly support team is always happy to help!":["Nasz szybki i przyjazny zesp\u00f3\u0142 pomocy technicznej zawsze ch\u0119tnie ci pomo\u017ce!"],"System Info":["Informacje systemowe"],"Collapse":["Zwi\u